      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "🚨 WATCH P-3 Leads High-Speed Pursuit: Marijuana Seized, Ecuadorian Smugglers Arrested 🚨\n\nA Jacksonville P-3, on routine patrol in the Caribbean Sea’s source and transit zone, detected a fast-moving vessel on June 11. The crew visually identified a 3-engine Ecuadorian-style go-fast boat loaded with fuel barrels and large packages. The position and details were quickly relayed to Joint Interagency Task Force South and the USCG.\n\nUSCG assets—including a helicopter and Over-the-Horizon vessels—responded rapidly. After an overflight, the suspect vessel stopped, allowing USCG teams to gain positive control.\n\nResult: 3,960 pounds of marijuana seized and 2 Ecuadorian suspects detained.\n\nOutstanding teamwork and coordination between NASOC-JAX, JIATF-S, and the USCG! #ProtectingAmerica #CounterNarcotics",
      "text_resolved": "🚨 WATCH P-3 Leads High-Speed Pursuit: Marijuana Seized, Ecuadorian Smugglers Arrested 🚨\n\nA Jacksonville P-3, on routine patrol in the Caribbean Sea’s source and transit zone, detected a fast-moving vessel on June 11. The crew visually identified a 3-engine Ecuadorian-style go-fast boat loaded with fuel barrels and large packages. The position and details were quickly relayed to Joint Interagency Task Force South and the USCG.\n\nUSCG assets—including a helicopter and Over-the-Horizon vessels—responded rapidly. After an overflight, the suspect vessel stopped, allowing USCG teams to gain positive control.\n\nResult: 3,960 pounds of marijuana seized and 2 Ecuadorian suspects detained.\n\nOutstanding teamwork and coordination between NASOC-JAX, JIATF-S, and the USCG! #ProtectingAmerica #CounterNarcotics",
